# ONE merged backend serves everything, reached through the same origin as the
# page: vite proxies /api to it in development (BACKEND_URL picks which one) and
# nginx does in production. Sign-in depends on it: the refresh cookie is scoped
# to /api/users/auth and refused on a cross-origin request.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
# The NEW_ variant defaults to VITE_API_BASE_URL — only set it if you really
# are splitting the backend across hosts.
#VITE_NEW_API_BASE_URL=
# PDF 上传/解析请求的超时时间（毫秒），默认 300000（5 分钟）
VITE_PDF_UPLOAD_TIMEOUT_MS=300000
